---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Sora Files" description="Read the Sora Files privacy policy and learn how PDF, image, HEIC, and Word files are processed locally in your browser." canonicalPath="/privacy">
  <Header />
  <main id="main" class="px-5 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="eyebrow text-xs font-semibold text-blue">Privacy Policy</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-balance text-[clamp(2.25rem,5.5vw,3.5rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.05em]">Your files stay yours.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-muted">Last updated August 9, 2026</p>
      <div class="mt-12 space-y-10 text-base leading-8 text-muted">
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Local file processing</h2><p class="mt-3">The current image, HEIC, PDF, ZIP, and DOCX tools process files inside your browser. Your selected files and generated results are not uploaded to a Sora Files server.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Temporary browser data</h2><p class="mt-3">Preview and download links exist temporarily in the open page. Sora Files releases those links when you remove a file or close the page. We do not store your image files.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Accounts and advertising</h2><p class="mt-3">Sora Files does not require a user account or ask you to sign in before using its file tools. The website is configured to use Google AdSense, and advertisements may appear after the site is approved for ad serving.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Google Analytics</h2><p class="mt-3">Sora Files uses Google Analytics 4 with measurement ID G-GQ973RY74K to understand page visits and improve the website. Google Analytics may collect a first-party client identifier, page and session activity, approximate location, and browser or device information. Google states that IP addresses may be used during collection for functions such as approximate geolocation and spam prevention, then discarded rather than logged or associated with user identifiers. Analytics data is sent to and processed by Google; it does not include the contents of files handled by the local PDF and image tools.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Google AdSense and advertising cookies</h2><p class="mt-3">Sora Files loads Google AdSense using publisher ID ca-pub-1154591227955054. When advertising is served, Google and its advertising partners may use cookies or similar local-storage technologies to deliver, limit, personalize, and measure advertisements; detect fraud and abuse; and generate advertising reports. Advertising data may include page activity, ad interactions, approximate location, browser or device information, and identifiers stored by Google or its partners. It does not include the contents of files processed locally by Sora Files. Ad personalization and storage are subject to applicable consent requirements and the choices available through Google and any consent message shown on the website. Learn more in <a class="font-medium text-blue underline underline-offset-4" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="external">Google's advertising policies</a>.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Processing engines</h2><p class="mt-3">HEIC files are decoded with libheif WebAssembly. PDFs use PDF.js and pdf-lib. Word workflows use Mammoth.js, docx, and jsPDF; ZIP downloads use fflate. These engines download as website code while your document content remains on this device.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Contact form submissions</h2><p class="mt-3">The Contact Us form is different from the local file tools. When you submit it, your name, email address, subject, message, and any optional attachment are transmitted to FormSubmit for delivery to <a href="/contact" class="font-medium text-blue underline decoration-blue/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-blue">Sora Files support</a>.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Questions</h2><p class="mt-3">Privacy questions can be sent through the <a class="font-medium text-blue underline underline-offset-4" href="/contact">Sora Files contact page</a>.</p></section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
